      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "猛獣が出るたび、村を護るため駆除するんだが、\n理由はあっても殺生は殺生……供養してやりたい。\n供養碑……つっても石を積んだ程度のものだが、\nそれの前で慰霊の舞を披露してほしい。頼んだぜ！",
        "official_en": "Any beast that attacks my village, I kill. I have to,\nto protect the people—but I still wanted to find a way\nto honor the lives I've taken. The memorial is scant\nmore than a pile of stones, but would you dance at it?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
